
# <type>(<scope>): <summary>     (lowercase, imperative, no period, <= 72 chars)
#
# - change one        (only when there are many changes, one bullet each)
# - change two
#
# Types: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# Scope: fish tmux nvim git install vscode claude docs ...
# Breaking: feat(scope)!: ...  plus a "BREAKING CHANGE: ..." line
# Short and clear. No emoji or icons.
#
# Guide: ~/dotfiles/GIT-FLOW.md
